# Log

Newest first. Each entry records a decision, a reversal, a blocker hit or cleared, a surprise
that changes the plan, or a piece of work finished or abandoned and why. Do not log typo
fixes, formatting, lint cleanups or doc wording. A log full of trivia is a log nobody reads.

Timestamps: full ISO 8601 with offset, from `date -Iseconds`.

## <ISO timestamp> — <title>

- What: <what was done or decided, one or two lines>
- Why: <the reason a future session would otherwise miss>
- Evidence: <command, output, link or file path that backs it up>

